---
description: Multi-tenant isolation requirements
alwaysApply: true
---

Every tenant-owned table and query must be tenant scoped.

Composite foreign keys must include tenant_id so Tenant A cannot reference Tenant B rows.

RLS is defense in depth, not a substitute for application WHERE tenant_id filters.

Client portal queries must use the authenticated clientId. Employees see assigned or self-owned work only.

Permission-denied responses must not leak whether an inaccessible resource exists.
